<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Then, I understand that this time you wish to begin from the second arc, '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc', but there are several points to note.<PG>
After you have heard those points, if you wish to start over from the beginning, please do not hesitate to tell me.<PG>
First of all, as for the first point, the scenarios you viewed in the Jusatsu Arc are all marked as already played.<PG>
However, please note that some of the scenarios have been revised.<PG>
As for the second point, the references and the encyclopedia are all in the unviewed state.<PG>
And third, the chatter, with some exceptions, is complete across the whole range of the Jusatsu Arc.<PG>
Also, there are some items whose specifications have changed.<PG>
In the scenarios, the references and the chatter, 'points' will accumulate. The concept called points did not exist last time.<PG>
These points are used to view certain references.<PG>
If you begin from the second arc, I shall provide the points obtainable in the Jusatsu Arc from the start.<PG>
The references that use these points are in the 'letters' format, which appeared last time as well. The points are used when viewing this reference.<PG>
For details, please see the help in the letters reference.<PG>
In addition, a reference in a further unknown format has also been added, and because its unlock conditions are strict, I should very much like you to seek it out.<PG>
This has grown long, but the above are the matters to note. To summarize―<PG>
1. Scenario revisions present　2. Scenarios: all viewed, references and encyclopedia: all <STYLE ID="2">un</STYLE>viewed, chatter: <STYLE ID="2">partly</STYLE> unviewed　3. There is a concept called points<PG>
Now that you have heard this much, allow me to confirm whether you will begin from the second arc.<PG>
Will you begin from the second arc, '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc'?
